Grounds work on a mixed-use commercial development has wrapped ahead of schedule, covering site grading and drainage, pathway and driveway hardscaping, and final softscape planting across the property.

The project is one of several commercial site development jobs completed this quarter by LAVS Trading's employee-owned landscaping team, who handled the work end-to-end — from initial site walk through handover.
